// duel_25v25's Cleave — AOE Path B production proof, single Damage in
// Circle(1.0). The dispatcher walks the 27-cell neighbourhood around the
// dispatched target and emits one chronicle record per in-radius
// candidate. Radius 1.0 ≤ SPATIAL_CELL_SIZE (6.0) so the single 27-cell
// walk covers the full circle.
//
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 0, hostile_only: true },
//                            area: SingleTarget { range: 3.0 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Damage { amount: 2.0 }],
//                            per_effect_areas: [Some(Circle(1.0))] }.

ability Cleave {
    target: enemy
    range: 3.0
    cooldown: 0

    damage 2 in circle(1.0)
}
